 per environment · concurrency: one release at a time)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FAFBFD;strokeColor=#0B2A4A;strokeWidth=1.5;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0B2A4A;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="20" y="360" width="1614" height="420" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c34" value="build" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F8FA;strokeColor=#24292F;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#24292F;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="35" y="400" width="215" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c35" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Workflow.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="210" y="406" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c36" value="API: lint · tests · coverage&lt;br&gt;React: lint · tests · &lt;b&gt;vite build&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;validate Bicep (3 envs)&lt;br&gt;version &lt;b&gt;2.0.0+&amp;lt;run&amp;gt;.&amp;lt;sha&amp;gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;API prod deps + React dist&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;→ public/ + build.json&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;eurc-app.zip&lt;/b&gt; → artifact&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;One package (API + UI) for every environment.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="45" y="434" width="195" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c37" value="dev  (automatic)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F5E9;strokeColor=#107C10;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#107C10;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="275" y="400" width="235" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c38" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/app_services/App_Services.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="470" y="406" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c39" value="azure/login — id-eurc-gh-dev-cc&lt;br&gt;deploy-infra: what-if + Bicep&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;(only if infra/ changed,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;forced, or first deploy)&lt;br&gt;az webapp deploy (zip)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;smoke&lt;/b&gt;: 8 checks, waits for&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;Healthy + expected version&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;+ React bundle served&lt;br&gt;reusable: _deploy-env.yml" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="285" y="434" width="215" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c40" value="test  (automatic)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#B45309;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="535" y="400" width="255" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c41" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Load_Test.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="750" y="406" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c42" value="azure/login — id-eurc-gh-test-cc&lt;br&gt;deploy · &lt;b&gt;smoke&lt;/b&gt; 8 checks&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;integration&lt;/b&gt;: store trading day,&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;13 checks (SQL, Key Vault, Blob)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;load&lt;/b&gt;: 60 s × 10 workers, sales +&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;reads; p95 &amp;lt; 1.5 s, err &amp;lt; 1 %&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Playwright E2E&lt;/b&gt; (tester-owned):&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;5 journeys × desktop + tablet&lt;br&gt;JUnit + HTML report → artifact" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=middle;fontSize=10;align=left;verticalAlign=top;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="545" y="434" width="235" height="260" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c43" value="⏸&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;QA sign-off&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size:9px'&gt;env prod: tester approves&lt;br&gt;(lead = backup)&lt;br&gt;no self-approval&lt;/span&gt;" style="rhombus;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFF4E5;strokeColor=#B45309;fontSize=10;strokeWidth=2;fontFamily=Segoe UI;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="810" y="470" width="150" height="150" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c44" value="prod  (after QA sign-off)" style="rounded=1;absoluteArcSize=1;arcSize=10;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F1FB;strokeColor=#0078D4;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=13;fontColor=#0078D4;fontFamily=Segoe UI;fontStyle=1;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="980" y="400" width="420" height="300" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c45" value="" style="image;aspect=fixed;html=1;image=img/lib/azure2/general/Web_Slots.svg;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1360" y="406" width="30" height="30" as="geometry"/></mxCell><mxCell id="c46" value="azure/login — id-eurc-gh-prod-cc · deploy-infra&lt;br&gt;record version currently live&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;1&lt;/b&gt; deploy zip → &lt;b&gt;staging slot&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;2&lt;/b&gt; smoke staging (env=prod, slot=staging)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;3&lt;/b&gt; &lt;b&gt;swap&lt;/b&gt; staging ↔ production (warm-up /health = 200)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;4&lt;/b&gt; verify production (version, slot, health)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;5&lt;/b&gt; post-deploy gate: 3 min read-only traffic +&lt;br&gt;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;AppRequests failure rate &amp;lt; 2 % (Log Analytics)&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;6&lt;/b&gt; release annotation in Application Insights&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='color:#B91C1C'&gt;&lt;b&gt;failu